0,'Please wait on the platform for the train.','请在站台上等火车。',2,1),(401,61,'VR can make a game feel real.','虚拟现实能让游戏感觉很真实。',1,1),(402,61,'We used VR to explore the ocean in class.','课堂上我们用虚拟现实探索海洋。',2,1),(403,62,'For example, a dog is a friendly pet.','例如，狗是一种友好的宠物。',1,1),(404,62,'Many fruits are healthy; for example, apples and bananas.','许多水果很健康，例如苹果和香蕉。',2,1),(405,63,'Finland is a country in northern Europe.','芬兰是北欧的一个国家。',1,1),(406,63,'Many people visit Finland to see the northern lights.','许多人去芬兰看北极光。',2,1),(407,64,'The railway connects the two cities.','这条铁路连接两座城市。',1,1),(408,64,'We watched the train travel along the railway.','我们看着火车沿铁路行驶。',2,1),(409,65,'The new railway will connect the town to the airport.','新铁路将把小镇与机场连接起来。',1,1),(410,65,'Please connect your tablet to the Wi-Fi.','请把平板电脑连接到无线网络。',2,1),(411,66,'The new railway will go into service next month.','新铁路将于下个月投入使用。',1,1),(412,66,'The bus went into service after its safety check.','公交车通过安全检查后投入使用。',2,1),(413,67,'Think carefully before you answer.','回答前要认真思考。',1,1),(414,67,'I think this puzzle is fun.','我觉得这个拼图很有趣。',2,1),(415,68,'We will build a birdhouse this weekend.','这个周末我们要建一个鸟屋。',1,1),(416,68,'Workers are building a new playground.','工人们正在建一个新操场。',2,1),(419,70,'Earth is the planet where we live.','地球是我们生活的星球。',1,1),(420,70,'Earth looks blue from space.','从太空看，地球是蓝色的。',2,1),(656,69,'BeiDou Navigation Satellite System helps people find their way.','北斗卫星导航系统帮助人们辨认方向。',1,1),(657,69,'The BeiDou Navigation Satellite System can show our location.','北斗卫星导航系统可以显示我们的位置。',2,1),(658,173,'The satellite travels around the Earth.','这颗人造卫星绕着地球运行。',1,1),(659,173,'We watched a satellite move across the night sky.','我们看到一颗人造卫星划过夜空。',2,1),(660,174,'This machine can clean the floor.','这台机器可以清洁地板。',1,1),(661,174,'The machine is easy for children to use.','这台机器很容易让孩子使用。',2,1),(662,175,'The classroom looks as bright as before.','教室看起来像以前一样明亮。',1,1),(663,175,'She smiled as before and said hello.','她像以前一样微笑着打招呼。',2,1),(664,176,'My role model always helps other people.','我的榜样总是帮助别人。',1,1),(665,176,'A good role model works hard and stays kind.','一个好的榜样努力工作并保持友善。',2,1),(666,177,'The musician plays the piano beautifully.','这位音乐家钢琴弹得很好。',1,1),(667,177,'The young musician practises every day.','这位年轻的音乐家每天练习。',2,1),(668,178,'We sang the March of the Volunteers together.','我们一起唱了《义勇军进行曲》。',1,1),(669,178,'The March of the Volunteers is our national anthem.','《义勇军进行曲》是我们的国歌。',2,1),(670,179,'Everyone stood up for the national anthem.','大家为国歌起立。',1,1),(671,179,'The national anthem began after the speech.','演讲结束后，国歌响起。',2,1),(672,180,'Every person can make a difference.','每个人都可以带来改变。',1,1),(673,180,'One person helped us find the way.','一个人帮助我们找到了路。',2,1),(674,181,'The educator teaches children with patience.','这位教育家耐心地教孩子们。',1,1),(675,181,'The educator wrote many books for teachers.','这位教育家为教师写了很多书。',2,1),(676,182,'Education opens doors to new opportunities.','教育为新的机会打开大门。',1,1),(677,182,'Good education helps children grow.','良好的教育帮助孩子成长。',2,1),(678,183,'This collection includes old songs.','这个作品集收录了老歌曲。',1,1),(679,183,'She showed me her stamp collection.','她给我看了她的邮票收藏。',2,1),(680,184,'The reader asked a good question.','这位读者问了一个好问题。',1,1),(681,184,'Every reader can learn something new.','每位读者都能学到新东西。',2,1),(682,185,'Denmark is a country in Europe.','丹麦是欧洲的一个国家。',1,1),(683,185,'She wants to visit Denmark one day.','她希望有一天去丹麦。',2,1),(684,186,'The friendly dog wagged its tail.','那只友好的狗摇了摇尾巴。',1,1),(685,186,'Our new neighbour is very friendly.','我们的新邻居非常友好。',2,1),(686,187,'The doctor gave the child a sugar pill instead of real medicine.','医生给孩子服用了一颗糖丸，而不是真正的药。',1,1),(687,187,'The sugar pill looked like real medicine.','糖丸看起来像真正的药。',2,1),(688,188,'Scientists develop new medicines.','科学家研发新药。',1,1),(689,188,'The team will develop a safer machine.','团队将开发更安全的机器。',2,1),(690,189,'The vaccine helped protect children from polio.','疫苗帮助保护孩子们免受脊髓灰质炎侵害。',1,1),(691,189,'Doctors worked hard to stop polio.','医生们努